Package: moderncor
Type: Package
Title: Unified Interface for Modern and Classical Correlation Coefficients
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Toshihiro", "Iguchi", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                   email = "toshihiro.iguchi.mail@gmail.com")
Description: Provides a single unified function to compute a wide variety of
    correlation and association measures including Pearson, Spearman, Kendall,
    distance correlation, maximal information coefficient (MIC),
    Hilbert-Schmidt independence criterion (HSIC), Chatterjee's xi correlation,
    Hoeffding's D, and mutual information.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/ToshihiroIguchi/moderncor
BugReports: https://github.com/ToshihiroIguchi/moderncor/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    stats,
    energy,
    XICOR
Suggests:
    minerva,
    Hmisc,
    dHSIC,
    infotheo,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
Config/testthat/edition: 3
